# Download

To download the game ZIP, run this command in a terminal:

```bash
curl -L -o Arena-Shooter-AS.zip "https://github.com/yin78291-png/Arena-Shooter-AS/archive/refs/heads/main.zip"
```

Then extract `Arena-Shooter-AS.zip` and open `aren1.5.html` in your browser.

> This command uses `curl`, not npm. You do not need npm to download or play the game.

[Download the repository as a ZIP file](https://github.com/yin78291-png/Arena-Shooter-AS/archive/refs/heads/main.zip)
